{
    "title": "Street Diver",
    "description": "Play the newest Flip game!\r\n\r\nJump from an amazing variety of locations, from your regular day town to the tension of the Wild West or the amazing sci-fi World, there are tons of levels to explore! Land on specific targets, perform amazing frontflips and backflips to get more points and get rewarded for crashing!\r\n\r\nEXPLORE OUR SAGA MAP\r\n\u2022 Complete levels, earn stars and progress through our saga map\r\n\u2022 Jump from amazing settings: From the Viking world to a city in space, the universe is your playground!\r\n\r\nSHARE YOUR FUNNIEST MOMENTS\r\n\u2022 Get rewarded for crashing! \r\n\u2022 Share your best jumps and your hilarious fails  with your friends!\r\nOur ragdoll physics engine will make sure to provide you memorable moments!\r\n\r\nTONS OF CUSTOMISATION AND CHARACTERS TO UNLOCK\r\n\u2022 Unlock unique characters: Rockstars, sportsman, zombies, mummies, warriors..  Over 50 characters for you to unlock!\r\n\u2022 Mix and Match body parts and create your unique character!\r\n\u2022 New content delivered regularly!\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n\r\nThis game does not require internet connection, and can be played offline.\r\nThis game includes optional in-game purchases (includes random items).",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play the newest Flip game!<br><br>Jump from an amazing variety of locations, from your regular day town to the tension of the Wild West or the amazing sci-fi World, there are tons of levels to explore! Land on specific targets, perform amazing frontflips and backflips to get more points and get rewarded for crashing!<br><br>EXPLORE OUR SAGA MAP<br>\u2022 Complete levels, earn stars and progress through our saga map<br>\u2022 Jump from amazing settings: From the Viking world to a city in space, the universe is your playground!<br><br>SHARE YOUR FUNNIEST MOMENTS<br>\u2022 Get rewarded for crashing! <br>\u2022 Share your best jumps and your hilarious fails  with your friends!<br>Our ragdoll physics engine will make sure to provide you memorable moments!<br><br>TONS OF CUSTOMISATION AND CHARACTERS TO UNLOCK<br>\u2022 Unlock unique characters: Rockstars, sportsman, zombies, mummies, warriors..  Over 50 characters for you to unlock!<br>\u2022 Mix and Match body parts and create your unique character!<br>\u2022 New content delivered regularly!<br><br>----------------------------------------<br><br>This game does not require internet connection, and can be played offline.<br>This game includes optional in-game purchases (includes random items).",
